 "equipment_type": "Fan coil unit controller (room thermostat)",
 "applies_to": "Fan coils and zoning equipment controlled by the TEC26xx-0+PIR thermostats, which add remote input and heat/cool output configuration objects to the TEC26x6 object set.",
 "summary": "The TEC26xx-0+PIR table uses the same instances as the TEC26x6(H)-4 list for modes, occupancy, setpoints, humidity and alarms, and adds objects for remote inputs (RUI 1, RBI 2), heating and cooling cycle rates, normally-open/closed outputs, demand limits, pulsed heat and fan control. It runs on BACnet MS/TP.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
